@startuml

[*] --> UserAccountCreated : CreateAccount, Login

UserAccountCreated --> UserLoggedIn : Login
UserLoggedIn --> VisaApplicationPending : ApplyForVisa, MakePayment, AcceptApplication
VisaApplicationPending --> VisaApproved : UpdateStatus [if approved]
VisaApplicationPending --> VisaRejected : UpdateStatus [if rejected]
UserLoggedIn --> StatusViewed : ViewStatus
StatusViewed --> CheckStatus : CheckStatus
UserLoggedIn --> CancelApplication : CancelApplication
UserLoggedIn --> ModifyDetails : ModifyDetails
UserLoggedIn --> ViewDetails : ViewDetails
UserLoggedIn --> ViewPurposeOfApplication : ViewPurposeOfApplication
UserLoggedIn --> FeedbackGiven : GiveFeedback, Logout

VisaApproved --> [*] : -
VisaRejected --> [*] : -

@enduml
